    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54843" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-πληκτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>striking, astonishing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρόσωπος καὶ κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Macho
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				13.578c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπρέπεια κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Hom.</u>
				p.58O.
			</span></i>; <i>terrible</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσβολαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.13.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσοψις, διήγησις,
			κραυγή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.114.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.28.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				11.16.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ εἰς πόλεμον κ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.16
			</span></i>; but expressly opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοβερός</span>
			in <i><span class="en">
				Muson.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				33p.122H.
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταλλακτικός</span>).
				Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.41.3
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.35
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
